 "description": "BMW Gen5 eDrive: battery control unit SME (6F1 -> 607, extended addressing 07; over ENET control unit 0x07). State of charge from 22E5CE (INT16/100), cell temperature min/max from 22DDC0 (INT16 signed /100). 22DDBC, which gives the state of charge on the i3, answers 0 here and is not used. Voltage 22DD68 and current 22DD69 as on the i3, unverified for Gen5. No SoH is known for Gen5 yet.",
